    "body": "# Fix: `hashCode`\n\n## Explanation\n\nThe `hashCode()` method in the `Schedule$Item` class is using the `MessageDigestSpec` to generate a hash code for the object. However, the algorithm being used is not one of the supported algorithms by the `MessageDigestSpec`, which only allows SHA-256, SHA-384, and SHA-512. Using MD5 as an algorith\n\n---\n\n## Modified Method\n\n| Property | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Method | `hashCode` |\n| Class | `net.gaast.giggity.Schedule$Item` |\n| File | `/mnt/c/Users/Antonow/Documents/tcc_v3/outputs/cloned_projects/net.gaast.giggity_769.apk/app/src/main/java/net/gaast/giggity/Schedule.java` |\n| Status | `SUCCESS` |\n\n---\n\n## Changed File\n\n```text\n/mnt/c/Users/Antonow/Documents/tcc_v3/outputs/cloned_projects/net.gaast.giggity_769.apk/app/src/main/java/net/gaast/giggity/Schedule.java\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\n- [x] Method replaced in source file\n- [x] Repository updated\n- [x] Commit generated\n- [ ] Manual review required\n- [ ] CI validation pending\n\n---\n\nRepair Pipeline",
